WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.667
Review the processing dashboard, deadlines and application status.

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:15.583
Prioritise orders and suggested follow-up. Traveller details are masked.

00:00:15.583 --> 00:00:20.583
Open the configured visa offerings.

00:00:20.583 --> 00:00:25.583
Review a visa product’s availability and pricing controls.

00:00:25.583 --> 00:00:30.583
Adjust the configured price.

00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:35.583
The recorded interface confirms the price update.

00:00:35.583 --> 00:00:40.583
Review the confirmation before changing availability.

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:45.583
The product’s availability state updates.

00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:50.583
Open agency-specific pricing.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:55.583
Choose whether to use the default price for an agency.

00:00:55.583 --> 00:01:00.583
Set an agency-specific price. Recorded values are not a current offer.

00:01:00.583 --> 00:01:05.583
Review connected agencies.

00:01:05.583 --> 00:01:10.583
Manage an agency connection’s enabled state.

00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:15.583
Open agency access and pricing controls.

00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:20.583
Choose which visa products the agency can access.

00:01:20.583 --> 00:01:25.583
Review the configured agency-specific access and pricing.

00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:30.583
Return to connected agencies.

00:01:30.583 --> 00:01:35.583
Review promotions and incentives.

00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:39.667
Configure campaign conditions and budget.

00:01:39.667 --> 00:01:44.667
Return to the campaign list.

00:01:44.667 --> 00:01:47.000
Open the billing overview.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:56.083
Explore usage and the per-visa breakdown.

00:01:56.083 --> 00:02:01.083
Review processing volume and billing history.

00:02:01.083 --> 00:02:04.583
Inspect the recorded pricing and settlement setup.

00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:09.583
Manage saved payment methods. Account details are masked.

00:02:09.583 --> 00:02:11.833
Open the payment-method form.

00:02:11.833 --> 00:02:16.833
Return to payment settings.

00:02:16.833 --> 00:02:19.750
Review billing cycles and statements.

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:24.750
Inspect the debit and payout history.
